## Development

Contributions – whether they are bug reports, suggestions, or code – are welcome!

Source check:
```bash
python -m pip install -e ".[test,lint,benchmark]"
ruff check src tests examples
ruff format --check src tests examples
pytest -m "not reference_corpus"
```

Correctness, proof boundaries and performance tested separately. See [testing guide](https://github.com/BhuvaneshBhatt/asymptotic/blob/main/docs/testing.md) and [documentation guide](https://github.com/BhuvaneshBhatt/asymptotic/blob/main/docs/documentation.md).

Maintainers can follow the [release guide](https://github.com/BhuvaneshBhatt/asymptotic/blob/main/docs/releasing.md) for artifact checks and publishing gates.

